WEBVTT

06:02.931 --> 06:05.099
You can't...

06:05.224 --> 06:06.684
Do you understand?

06:13.650 --> 06:15.735
The Prince will
remember that, little lord.

06:15.860 --> 06:17.779
I hope so.

06:17.904 --> 06:21.199
If he forgets, be a good dog
and remind him.

06:24.077 --> 06:27.121
Ah. Time for breakfast.
